flowchart LR
    INVESTIGATOR((Clinical-trial investigator))
    MAINTAINER((TrialIQ maintainer))

    INVESTIGATOR --> UC1[Look up a study of interest]
    INVESTIGATOR --> UC2[Ask a guided related-study question]
    INVESTIGATOR --> UC3[Review broad candidate set]
    INVESTIGATOR --> UC4[Compare study timing / duration / enrollment]
    INVESTIGATOR --> UC5[Understand Condition / Intervention / Sponsor connections]
    INVESTIGATOR --> UC6[Inspect source evidence and validation]
    INVESTIGATOR --> UC7[Prepare and download a PDF report]

    MAINTAINER --> UC8[Restore AACT source]
    MAINTAINER --> UC9[Build/reconcile canonical Neo4j graph]
    MAINTAINER --> UC10[Run TrialIQ readiness and release gate]
    MAINTAINER --> UC11[Qualify stable demo scenarios]
    MAINTAINER --> UC12[Recover TrialIQ from a clean machine]
